WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.150
Test for Super Chef,

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:37.580
the highest award of Chinese chef,

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.190
has come to the last stage.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.800
Five competitors grade each other.

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.270
But Che Lin and Tang

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:46.730
lost their qualification before this.

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:49.600
Han, Fei and I

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:51.070
entered the final stage.

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:52.080
Three people.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.720
The result…

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:58.540
Now, we will

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.770
show the final score of your three.

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:11.710
The noble badge

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.950
Han, ten.

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:19.500
Mao, nine.

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:21.750
Fei, nine.

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:23.600
Han won?

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:25.280
Mao lost?

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.490
I’m the top!

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:35.370
I finally become a Super Chef!

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.050
Han, stand forward.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:44.670
Yes.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:55.700
Han from Dongjiang Restaurant,

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.230
your beef noodle with egg

00:02:58.340 --> 00:02:59.960
is quite excellent.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.930
It suits the topic of \"No Flour\" noodles.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.400
Your innovative idea

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:08.030
has shown an unprecedented taste.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.250
Both the preliminary test

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.050
and the official test

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.350
have proved that you have

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.060
great strength.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.990
I finally won the honor of

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.040
Super Chef!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:21.460
Han.

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:22.020
Yes.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:24.650
You have completed two contests.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.610
Now you may go back.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:27.620
Yes.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:29.470
What?

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.900
Sorry, what do you mean?

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:36.350
I thought I should undergo some process.

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:38.110
Don't you understand?

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.070
You are not qualified.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:41.950
Please leave now.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.290
Wait! What's going on?

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.610
I thought I have beaten them.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.140
You see!

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.570
I need an explanation.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.220
Why am I unqualified?

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.440
Stupid!

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.330
Why did I adopt the way of

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.230
letting competitors grade each other?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:00.500
Calm down

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.270
and think about my purpose.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.430
This is the grading list.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.310
Look at it carefully.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.070
How did everyone grade?

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:23.940
Mao and Fei

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:26.520
graded Han five points each.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.150
Han got ten.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:29.270
But Han

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.920
only graded one

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.680
for others’ work.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.500
You graded me one?

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:40.190
Mao and Fei graded each other eight.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.720
Their total scores are nine.

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:43.560
Of course your score is higher.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.080
That's unfair!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.270
Han

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.110
gott the highest score of course!

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:52.860
Han,

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.410
you are

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.620
blinded by your competitiveness.

00:04:57.220 --> 00:04:58.000
You gave them

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:58.600
the scores

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.740
in an obviously biased way.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.520
Those who cannot rate other people's work justly

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:06.610
are not entitled to be a Super Chef.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.170
You may come here four years later.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:50.170
Please forgive my selfishness.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.160
Mrs. Kaminaribana, you are right.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.610
I'm a loser.

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:56.550
Now, I

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.280
feel deeply ashamed

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.140
of what I did.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.490
Fei, Mao.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.820
Your work are both amazing.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.810
I know that I'm not your rivals.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.340
I decide to restart practices.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:22.680
I'll be back four years later.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:23.510
See you.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:29.560
Han!

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.440
Miss Keling, hurry up!

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.310
If we are found by Chef Zhou Yu,

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.100
it’ll be terrible!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:47.870
It's dark here. Be careful.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:48.960
Okay.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:52.820
Sorry.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:57.930
Let's go.

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:00.310
The test result is about to come out.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:03.190
Stand there!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.000
It's too early.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.450
What are you doing here?

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.930
It's too early to buy food.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:12.860
Well...

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:13.830
We cannot sleep,

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.020
so we want to have a walk.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.430
Five people?

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.340
Yeah.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.950
Sometimes people will be like that.

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.160
Right, Zhou Yu?

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.260
Yeah.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:26.910
Quite right.

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:29.990
In fact we also

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.640
cannot sleep well.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:35.140
We want to go out for a walk.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.390
So excuse us.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.580
Excuse us.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.470
Where are you going?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.470
Cooking Arena.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.440
What?

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:45.500
Fine.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.750
Lan Feihong from Datong Restaurant.

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:56.430
Mao from Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.710
You have done a great job.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.050
So now,

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:01.720
here's my final challenge for you.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:02.860
The final challenge?

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:03.700
I knew that

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.620
you can both

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.900
evaluate other people's work justly.

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:08.460
So this time,

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:09.900
please grade

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.540
your own work.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.730
Grade our own work?

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:17.250
People know the least about themselves.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.390
This challenge sounds easy,

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:21.410
but it is the hardest one.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:33.940
I'm feeling good about my dishes,

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:36.660
but if I'm asked to grade myself...

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.070
First, Mao.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:50.820
Yes.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:53.190
The catfish-meat noodle you made

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.350
has squid shreds in it.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.190
So it becomes more chewy.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:58.510
This is a bold and successful

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.690
work that expresses the theme today.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:03.060
This catfish-meat noodle is innovative.

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:03.990
Mao.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:04.580
Yes.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:05.970
Please grade your dish.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.280
Ten is full marks.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.100
I grade ten scores.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:26.360
Ten scores.

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:27.510
Ten?

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.490
No!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:33.740
How can you

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.100
grade your own work ten?

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.210
You should be modest.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.330
What's your reason?

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:40.070
Yes.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.230
Maybe I'm not experienced enough

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:44.130
as a cook.

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:47.220
But I have done my best

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.810
to do this dish.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.820
I think I've made the best food.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.450
As a chef,

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:53.470
I can do nothing

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:54.340
but give myself ten points.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:58.330
Fei,

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.320
your dish

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.970
used tomatoes

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:04.730
to create this springy cold noodles

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:06.520
with indistinct sweetness.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:10.010
It's refreshing like ice.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:12.710
Fei, what's your score?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.030
Also ten.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:20.250
Ten!

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.940
My reason

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.230
is the same with Mao's.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.790
The two are both ten.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:29.920
Who will be the Super Chef?

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:47.940
I’m now announcing

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:52.040
the winner of Super Chef test.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.990
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:07.550
Lan Feihong from Datong Restaurant

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:10.790
and Mao from Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.330
The tastes and the skills

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:13.840
of your noodles

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.660
are neck and neck.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.300
Your cooking skills

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.950
can make you both the Super Chef.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.080
Meanwhile,

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:25.060
I asked you to grade your work

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.610
in order to test whether

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.920
you have the confidence as a chef.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.770
You both performed well.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:34.190
Fei. Mao.

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:36.780
This time my decision is exceptional.

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:39.570
You are both qualified.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:57.040
Yeah!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.810
Mao.

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:04.370
You win. Congratulations!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.160
So great!

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.390
I did it, Meili!

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.840
I can be closer to my mother.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:12.200
Your efforts have paid off!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.090
Congratulations!

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:14.870
Thanks for your help.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:16.150
Unbelievable.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:17.740
He is just a

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:19.700
13-year-old child.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.290
He

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.400
and the dishes he made

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:24.720
somehow

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.040
have an indescribable attraction.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.040
Maybe it's because

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:30.860
he tries his best

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:33.110
to do every dish.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.940
I really want to compete with him again.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:40.910
We just got our results,

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.430
but the morale in my heart

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.560
boosts again.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.360
Maybe it's the arrangement of Chef Pai.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:53.860
Mao, Fei.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.120
Now I award you

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.440
the badges of Super Chef.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:12:59.430
Yes.

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:14.640
Put it on your sleeve.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:15.690
Yes.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.640
(Super)

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.630
This is the badge of Super Chef.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.560
It looks good on you, Mao.

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.140
Thanks.

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:41.840
You two, listen.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.350
The honor of Super Chef

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.090
is only a decoration.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.310
For you,

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.410
passing this test

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.230
is only a part of the journey

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.160
to improve yourself.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:55.630
You must keep learning!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:56.510
Yes!

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:02.080
Fei,

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:03.780
if I have the chance

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:05.090
to compete with you,

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:06.350
I will never lose the game.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:08.820
I'm waiting for you to say this.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.290
I'm willing to compete with you.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:11.140
Okay.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:12.790
Okay.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.280
Pai, my rival.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.930
Your students are too excellent.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:20.920
Fei from Guangzhou.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.290
Mao from Sichuan.

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:23.840
When these two stars

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.520
become more shiny,

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:28.860
China's food

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:30.700
will make a great progress

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.280
and enter into a higher level.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:48.090
Keling!

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:49.340
Mao!

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:52.380
Super Chef's badge!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:56.910
Mao,

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.630
you did it!

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:02.600
Mao, you finally became a super chef!

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:03.350
Keling!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.010
Great job, Mao!

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.190
Congratulations!

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.770
Great!

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:10.240
This is the badge of Super Chef.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.790
Let me see it.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:14.680
The youngest Super Chef

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.340
in history.

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:18.200
This guy

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.120
is so amazing.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.330
Youth can give you

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.000
so many things, Zhou Yu.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.450
Here, the catfish noodles

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:36.420
Mao had made

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:37.710
in the Super Chef test.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:38.860
This is a celebration,

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.020
so please enjoy yourself.

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.860
My treat!

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.030
Yummy!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.710
Catfish can make noodles!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.560
It's like magic.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.780
Super Chef's food is so great.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:55.860
One more!

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:56.920
Okay.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:06.990
Commander Li.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:09.660
Mao.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:11.210
I heard that

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.270
you have become a Super Chef.

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:15.310
It's great!

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.010
Thank you so much.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:17.850
Mao.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.500
It's time for you to return to Sichuan.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.120
Based on our agreement,

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:26.210
I appoint you,

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.760
the Super Chef,

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:28.830
officially as the

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.280
new chef of Sichuan Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:33.260
Mao, congratulations!

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.310
You can finally inherit your mom's restaurant.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.070
Mao.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:46.910
Commander Li,

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.080
I don't want to return to Sichuan right now.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.330
What?

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:52.470
Mao!

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.150
Since I was in Guangzhou,

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:56.230
the things I saw and the food I tasted

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:57.850
are so new to me.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.600
I also met a lot of people.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:00.980
During these days,

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.110
I have been filled with admiration about cooking.

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:04.480
In the field of cooking,

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:07.490
I have so much to learn.

00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:09.570
If I stop here,

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.220
and inherit Chrysanthemum Tower,

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:11.750
My mother

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.020
will not feel happy for me.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.720
You mean,

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:16.780
you want to stay in Guangzhou?

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:17.720
No.

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:19.670
Mao.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.160
I plan to start my journey of cooking learning.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.300
Learning?

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:28.370
Mao.

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:32.970
China is vast.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.330
On this land,

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:36.720
there are so many cuisines that I haven't seen,

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:38.310
and so many great chefs that I haven't met.

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:40.570
Through this journey,

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.030
I will expand my horizon

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.680
and look at the world outside.

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:46.580
Actually I thought that you would say this.

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:49.280
Based on your ambition,

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:50.960
you will never stop learning

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.000
even though you have become a super chef.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:53.260
Mao.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:53.970
Yes.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.430
You shall remember

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:57.170
and cherish your feeling at this moment forever.

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:59.320
You may learn and see as you like

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:01.070
on this vast land.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.640
Thank you, Commander Li.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:09.180
How come?

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:12.530
I thought you will be here forever.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:17.270
Meili!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:30.500
Mao.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:31.890
You should be careful.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.760
You only think about cooking

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.540
and you may be confused about every other thing.

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.240
Don't worry, Keling.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.180
I'm not a child anymore.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.450
You are.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.630
Don't worry!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:44.640
Mao is bright and hearty.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:45.890
No trouble wants to

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.710
approach him!

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:49.690
Sounds good.

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:53.630
Mao, what are you looking at?

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:55.630
Where's Meili?

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.020
Meili said she got plans

00:18:58.060 --> 00:18:59.310
so she couldn't be here.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:01.090
Right,

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:03.210
she asked me

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:07.150
to give you this.

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:09.320
A scarf.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.020
I remember!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.640
Last night I saw her

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.980
cry

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.570
while making this scarf.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:16.770
Meili knows that

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:18.120
this journey

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:19.900
can surely make Mao

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.000
become better.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:22.340
Meili.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.130
Goodbye.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.280
Take care!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:33.950
Mao!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:37.050
You should find Jia Xiong in Quqing Village!

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:37.760
Okay!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.240
Mao!

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:41.100
Take care of yourself!

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.590
Eat clean and healthy food!

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:45.210
You are a greedy boy!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.740
Don't worry!

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.510
I'm not a child anymore.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.910
I'm waiting you in Sichuan!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.290
Goodbye!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.510
Mao!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:14.260
Goodbye, Mao!

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:16.400
Recalling those moments with you

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:17.560
makes me so happy.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:20.060
Because no matter what troubles you meet,

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:22.110
you will face the challenges with your smile.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.260
When I was with you,

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:25.790
sometimes I couldn't help to be a sticky beak.

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:27.880
Sometimes I worried about you so much.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.190
I thought Mao would

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:31.170
be with me forever.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.550
So,

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:34.310
when you said you'd take a trip,

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.520
I really didn't know what to do.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.400
When we meet in the future,

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.020
I believe you and me

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.810
will be more mature.

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:42.570
Looking forward to seeing you again.

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:44.880
Mao, goodbye.

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:46.810
Meili!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:49.750
Meili!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:54.590
I should have

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:58.390
been nicer to her.

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:01.190
Thank you.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:14.460
Actually I have thought a lot.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.090
I decide to go with you.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:21.540
Because you are such a worrying boy.

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:22.980
Without me,

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.040
you may do nothing well.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:27.850
So, I'm going with you.

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:31.680
Mao!

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:36.940
Meili!

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:17.773
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.773 --> 00:23:19.689
During our cooking training journey,

00:23:19.689 --> 00:23:21.649
we met a boy.

00:23:21.733 --> 00:23:25.361
What? You're the youngest super chef ever?

00:23:25.361 --> 00:23:27.905
You want me to make you an apprentice? Oh, no.

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:29.866
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.866 --> 00:23:32.660
Genius Boy Chef?! Silang?

00:23:32.785 --> 00:23:34.454
It will definitely be interesting!
